title: Dues revolt
subtitle: The members can't pay!
tags: event
new-page: true
view-if: funds_timer <= 0 and funds_trigger
on-arrival: {!
var dues_limit = { workers: 4, old_middle: 4, new_middle: 4, unemployed: 2, rural: 3 };
var dues_drain = { workers: 3, old_middle: 2, new_middle: 3, unemployed: 6, rural: 4 };
for (var c in dues_limit) {
    var d = Q[c + '_dues'];
    if (d >= dues_limit[c]) {
        Q[c + '_spd'] -= dues_drain[c] * d;
    }
}
!}

= Dues are too high!

Branches report that members are falling behind on their dues. Some have stopped paying and others quietly stopped showing up altogether.

Something has to give.

- @cut_w: Lower dues for workers.
- @cut_u: Lower dues for the unemployed.
- @cut_nm: Lower dues for the new middle class.
- @cut_om: Lower dues for the old middle class.
- @cut_r: Lower dues for the rural members.
- @appeal: Appeal to solidarity.
- @hold: Hold the line.

@cut_w
view-if: workers_dues >= 4
on-arrival: workers_dues -= 1; workers_spd += 2; labor_dissent -= 3; left_dissent -= 2; funds_timer = 24; funds_trigger = 0

We eased the burden on our workers.

@cut_u
view-if: unemployed_dues >= 2
on-arrival: unemployed_dues -= 1; unemployed_spd += 4; left_dissent -= 3; labor_dissent -= 1; funds_timer = 24; funds_trigger = 0

Asking the jobless to pay was always a hard sell.

@cut_nm
view-if: new_middle_dues >= 4
on-arrival: new_middle_dues -= 1; new_middle_spd += 2; center_dissent -= 3; reformist_dissent -= 2; funds_timer = 24; funds_trigger = 0

The clerks and technicians welcome the cut, though the left grumbles that we are catering to the non-socialists.

@cut_om
view-if: old_middle_dues >= 4
on-arrival: old_middle_dues -= 1; old_middle_spd += 2; center_dissent -= 3; reformist_dissent -= 2; funds_timer = 24; funds_trigger = 0

The shopkeepers and artisans are placated, for now...

@cut_r
view-if: rural_dues >= 3
on-arrival: rural_dues -= 1; rural_spd += 2; center_dissent -= 2; funds_timer = 24; funds_trigger = 0

Rural members have been drifting to the Landvolk. This slows the bleeding.

@appeal
choose-if: dissent < 0.40
unavailable-subtitle: Members are straight up revolting...
subtitle: Dues stay, but we ask members to endure.
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 2; labor_dissent -= 1; workers_spd -= 1; unemployed_spd -= 1; funds_timer = 12; funds_trigger = 0

Speakers tour the branches talking about sacrifice and solidarity. It is not taken seriously, however, it could buy us some time.

@hold
subtitle: The party needs the money.
on-arrival: workers_spd -= 3; unemployed_spd -= 3; new_middle_spd -= 2; old_middle_spd -= 2; rural_spd -= 2; left_dissent += 4; labor_dissent += 4; center_dissent += 3; funds_timer = 6; funds_trigger = 0

We refused to budge...
